MODULE: HistoryConvergesOrdinaryNotDrained
TARGET: HistoryConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: a fair ordinary-drain action never consumes its available revision
PERTURBS: ReadOrdinary

--- FIND
ReadOrdinary ==
    /\ ~rebuilding /\ read < Len(log) /\ log[read + 1] = 1 /\ dirty = {}
--- REPLACE
ReadOrdinary ==
    /\ FALSE
    /\ ~rebuilding /\ read < Len(log) /\ log[read + 1] = 1 /\ dirty = {}
--- END
